PenguSafe adds a commit-confirmed style workflow to OPNsense.

An administrator can arm a protected configuration session before making
risky changes. PenguSafe stores a dedicated snapshot of /conf/config.xml and
starts a local watchdog. If the session is not confirmed before the deadline,
the snapshot is restored and the firewall reboots into the previous known
configuration.

No cloud service or browser connection is required for the rollback timer.
